                <div class="part-header">
                    <p><strong>Part 1</strong></p>
                    <p>Listen and answer questions 1–10.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="questions-container">
                    <div class="question">
                        <div class="question-prompt">
                            <p><strong>Questions 1-3</strong></p>
                            <p>Complete the notes below.</p>
                            <p>Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="example-box">
                            <p class="centered-title">Complaint to the airport</p>
                            <div class="aligned-form">
                                <div class="question-row"><span class="question-label">Name:</span> Jack Dawson</div>
                                <div class="question-row"><span class="question-label">Address:</span> <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">1</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_1_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_1" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 1"></span> Road, Exeter</div>
                                <div class="question-row"><span class="question-label">Postcode:</span> <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">2</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_2_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_2" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 2"></span></div>
                                <div class="question-row"><span class="question-label">Telephone:</span> work: <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">3</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_3_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_3" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 3"></span> home: 798662</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question">
                        <div class="question-prompt">
                            <p><strong>Questions 4-6</strong></p>
                            <p>Choose the correct answer.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div>
                            <p><strong>4</strong>  What aspect of the flight does the man complain about?</p>
                            <div class="multi-choice-question q-card ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">4</strong>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_4" value="A" id="practice_6_4_A" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 4: A"> punctuality</label></div>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_4" value="B" id="practice_6_4_B" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 4: B"> legroom</label></div>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_4" value="C" id="practice_6_4_C" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 4: C"> temperature</label></div>
                            </div>

                            <p><strong>5</strong>  What does the man think about the food served during the flight?</p>
                            <div class="multi-choice-question q-card ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">5</strong>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_5" value="A" id="practice_6_5_A" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 5: A"> It is not enough to eat.</label></div>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_5" value="B" id="practice_6_5_B" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 5: B"> It is expensive.</label></div>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_5" value="C" id="practice_6_5_C" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 5: C"> It has a bad taste.</label></div>
                            </div>

                            <p><strong>6</strong>  What does the man think of the service of the staff?</p>
                            <div class="multi-choice-question q-card ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">6</strong>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_6" value="A" id="practice_6_6_A" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 6: A"> satisfied</label></div>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_6" value="B" id="practice_6_6_B" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 6: B"> long wait</label></div>
                                <div class="multi-choice-option"><label><input type="radio" name="practice_6_6" value="C" id="practice_6_6_C" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 6: C"> bad attitude</label></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question">
                        <div class="question-prompt">
                            <p><strong>Questions 7-10</strong></p>
                            <p>Complete the sentences below.</p>
                            <p>Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS</strong> for each answer.</p>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="example-box">
                            <ul>
                                <li>•  The man felt satisfied with <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">7</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_7_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_7" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 7"></span> because it was quick.</li>
                                <li>•  During the flight, <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">8</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_8_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_8" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 8"></span> facilities helped him distract from other poor quality of the service.</li>
                                <li>•  As a gift, a 20% discount on the <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">9</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_9_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_9" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 9"></span> fees will be offered.</li>
                                <li>•  The flight company also offers the man a <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">10</strong><input type="text" id="practice_6_10_" class="answer-input" placeholder="Answer" name="practice_6_10" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 10"></span> worth £20.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
