<p><span data-speaker="Speaker 3"><span data-cue-start="500.82" data-cue-end="500.98">In</span> <span data-cue-start="500.98" data-cue-end="501.38">addition,</span> <span data-cue-start="501.82" data-cue-end="502.14">applicants</span> <span data-cue-start="502.14" data-cue-end="502.46">must</span> <span data-cue-start="502.46" data-cue-end="502.84">supply</span> <span data-cue-start="502.84" data-cue-end="503.34">references</span> (Q13) </span><span data-speaker="Speaker 4"><span data-cue-start="503.34" data-cue-end="503.90">from</span> <span data-cue-start="503.90" data-cue-end="504.24">past</span> <span data-cue-start="504.24" data-cue-end="504.40">or</span> <span data-cue-start="504.40" data-cue-end="504.76">present</span> <span data-cue-start="504.76" data-cue-end="505.28">employers</span> <span data-cue-start="505.28" data-cue-end="505.68">or</span> <span data-cue-start="505.68" data-cue-end="506.18">teachers</span> <span data-cue-start="506.18" data-cue-end="506.62">along</span> </span><span data-speaker="Speaker 3"><span data-cue-start="506.62" data-cue-end="506.82">with</span> <span data-cue-start="506.82" data-cue-end="506.98">their</span> <span data-cue-start="506.98" data-cue-end="507.40">recent</span> <span data-cue-start="507.40" data-cue-end="507.76">CV</span> (Q14). <span data-cue-start="508.72" data-cue-end="509.02">These</span> <span data-cue-start="509.02" data-cue-end="509.50">references</span> <span data-cue-start="509.50" data-cue-end="509.98">must</span> <span data-cue-start="509.98" data-cue-end="510.56">testify</span> <span data-cue-start="510.56" data-cue-end="511.12">as</span> <span data-cue-start="511.12" data-cue-end="511.30">to</span> <span data-cue-start="511.30" data-cue-end="511.44">the</span> <span data-cue-start="511.44" data-cue-end="512.04">applicant's</span> <span data-cue-start="512.04" data-cue-end="512.32">work</span> <span data-cue-start="512.32" data-cue-end="512.66">habits</span> and/or <span data-cue-start="513.30" data-cu