<p><span data-speaker="Speaker 3"><span data-cue-start="528.46" data-cue-end="528.76">Although</span> <span data-cue-start="528.76" data-cue-end="529.16">all</span> <span data-cue-start="529.16" data-cue-end="529.60">positions</span> <span data-cue-start="529.60" data-cue-end="529.88">are</span> <span data-cue-start="529.88" data-cue-end="530.34">volunteer,</span> <span data-cue-start="530.82" data-cue-end="531.00">the</span> <span data-cue-start="531.00" data-cue-end="531.42">employer</span> <span data-cue-start="531.42" data-cue-end="531.72">will</span> <span data-cue-start="531.72" data-cue-end="532.20">reimburse</span> <span data-cue-start="532.20" data-cue-end="532.58">some</span> <span data-cue-start="532.58" data-cue-end="532.72">of</span> <span data-cue-start="532.72" data-cue-end="532.88">your</span> <span data-cue-start="532.88" data-cue-end="533.36">expenses.</span> <span data-cue-start="534.24" data-cue-end="534.50">For</span> <span data-cue-start="534.50" data-cue-end="534.88">example,</span> <span data-cue-start="535.44" data-cue-end="535.56">they</span> <span data-cue-start="535.56" data-cue-end="535.72">will</span> <span data-cue-start="535.72" data-cue-end="535.92">pay</span> <span data-cue-start="535.92" data-cue-end="536.12">for</span> <span data-cue-start="536.12" data-cue-end="536.72">transportation</span> (Q15) <span data-cue-start="536.72" data-cue-end="537.30">to</span> <span data-cue-start="537.30" data-cue-end="537.50">and</span> <span data-cue-start="537.50" data-cue-end="537.74">from</span> </span><span data-speaker="Speaker 1"><span data-cue-start="537.74" data-cue-end="537.90">the</span> <span data-cue-start="537.90" data-cue-end="538.04">job</span> <span data-cue-start="538.04" data-cue-end="538.40">site.</span> <span data-cue-start="539.36" data-cue-end="539.64">Aside</span> <span data-cue-start="539.64" data-cue-end="539.94">from</span> <span data-cue-start="539.94" data-cue-end="540.18">that,</span> <span data-cue-start="540.34" dat