<p><span data-speaker="Speaker 1"><span data-cue-start="583.40" data-cue-end="583.54">As</span> <span data-cue-start="583.54" data-cue-end="583.72">for</span> <span data-cue-start="583.72" data-cue-end="583.84">the</span> <span data-cue-start="583.84" data-cue-end="584.26">positions</span> <span data-cue-start="584.26" data-cue-end="584.86">themselves,</span> <span data-cue-start="585.38" data-cue-end="585.50">there</span> <span data-cue-start="585.50" data-cue-end="585.64">are</span> <span data-cue-start="585.64" data-cue-end="585.82">three</span> <span data-cue-start="585.82" data-cue-end="586.32">types.</span> <span data-cue-start="587.16" data-cue-end="587.24">The</span> <span data-cue-start="587.24" data-cue-end="587.52">first</span> <span data-cue-start="587.52" data-cue-end="588.06">involves</span> <span data-cue-start="588.06" data-cue-end="588.54">assisting</span> <span data-cue-start="588.54" data-cue-end="589.08">persons</span> <span data-cue-start="589.08" data-cue-end="589.56">confined</span> <span data-cue-start="589.56" data-cue-end="589.80">to</span> <span data-cue-start="589.80" data-cue-end="590.26">wheelchairs.</span> <span data-cue-start="591.20" data-cue-end="591.32">For</span> <span data-cue-start="591.32" data-cue-end="591.50">this</span> <span data-cue-start="591.50" data-cue-end="592.00">position,</span> <span data-cue-start="592.46" data-cue-end="592.78">volunteers</span> <span data-cue-start="592.78" data-cue-end="593.24">must</span> <span data-cue-start="593.24" data-cue-end="593.46">be</span> <span data-cue-start="593.46" data-cue-end="593.76">physically</span> <span data-cue-start="593.76" data-cue-end="594.16">fit</span> <span data-cue-start="594.16" data-cue-end="594.46">and</span> <span data-cue-start="594.46" data-cue-end="594.58">in</span> <span data-cue-start="594.58" data-cue-end="594.96">excellent</span> <span data-cue-start="594.96" data-cue-end="595.44">health.</span> <span data-cue-start="596.20" data-cue-end="596.40">They</s